summary: autotest for bz1063695
description: |
    Decription of problem:
    	Always "write error: Device or resource busy" when removing items within 'set_graph_function
    	Ftrace operations as below assuming debugfs mounted at /debug:
    	# cd tracing
    	# cat current_tracer
    	nop
    	# echo '*irq*' > set_graph_function
    	# wc -l set_graph_function
    	32 set_graph_function
    	# echo '!*8259A*' >> set_graph_function
    	-bash: echo: write error: Device or resource busy    <-----
    	# wc -l set_graph_function
    	32 set_graph_function
    Author: Yahuan Cong <ycong@redhat.com>
contact: Qiao Zhao <qzhao@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - trace-cmd
duration: 40m
tier: 2
tag: [tier2]
